## Components

| Path         | Type           | Responsibility                              |
| ------------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `commands/`  | Slash commands | User-invoked entry points.                  |
| `agents/`    | Subagents      | Delegated, task-scoped workers.             |
| `skills/`    | Skills         | Model-invoked capabilities and knowledge.   |
| `scripts/`   | Shell          | Deterministic, mechanized steps (no LLM).   |

## Model selection

Follow the repository principle of using the **minimum capable model** for each
subagent or command (`model:` frontmatter):

| Task character                          | Model    |
| --------------------------------------- | -------- |
| Deterministic / mechanical / lookups    | `haiku`  |
| Moderate reasoning, editing, review      | `sonnet` |
| Deep architecture, ambiguous problems    | `opus`   |

Prefer moving anything fully deterministic into `scripts/` so no model is spent
on it at all.

